WEBVTT

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.500
Oh, Maria-sama...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.200
I can hear it...

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.080
The terrible noise splitting Heaven and Earth...

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.250
A demon lurks in the shadows of this school...

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.290
Please!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.200
Offer your faithful servant your salvation!

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:45.450
I want a heart that can laugh without lying

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:57.120
If I hadn't wanted anything from the start

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:04.870
Maybe my heart wouldn't have sank so low

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:13.750
I know the joy of being loved

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:22.330
But it's not enough, it won't fill me up, it won't purge my fears

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:28.290
Won't you wet my bone-dry heart?

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:32.080
Pour the oil over it till it's overflowing

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:37.620
My scream echoes out in vain

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:43.870
I want to feel that this boring everyday life

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:47.540
Is a blessing bestowed upon me

00:01:47.540 --> 00:02:00.000
I want a heart that can laugh without lying

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:09.120
Gekkou
Itabashi

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:12.370
Maria's Dollhouse
Enter

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:16.870
Welcome, you disgusting maggots
wriggling through the night...

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:20.080
...to Maria's Dollhouse.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:24.330
As always, let's look at
some of your stupid, shitty worries.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.250
Maria-sama...

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.700
My name is Gekkou.

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:32.950
I met Mistress Maria in my wanderings
across the demonic electronic seas...

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:34.040
She dumped me.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:39.830
Maria-sama's guiding words
brought peace to my troubled soul.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:35.080
She dumped me.
She dumped me.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.040
She dumped me.
She dumped me.
I'm so sad.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.040
She dumped me.
She dumped me.
I'm so sad.
I don't know what to do.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.000
She dumped me.
She dumped me.
I'm so sad.
I don't know what to do.
I don't.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.200
She dumped me.
She dumped me.
I'm so sad.
I don't know what to do.
I don't.
I Just don't.

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:42.200
Hmm, so you got dumped, is that it?

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.950
So fucking what?
You deserve to be forever alone, asshole!

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.290
Next!

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:47.950
What a fool.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:50.290
I cut my wrists...
and my ankles.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:50.410
Then next you should cut your neck!

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:51.540
It doesn't hurt,

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.580
It doesn't hurt,
but please tell me

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:57.450
It doesn't hurt,
but please tell me
where my blood spills.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.700
Take that knife and plunge it into your heart!

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:57.450
And do it with force!

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:01.580
Oh, Maria-sama, please...

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:00.690
Maria-sama,

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:02.440
these electrical waves at school

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:03.700
Please hear my worries...

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:03.700
are eroding my brain

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.660
I know you'll save me today...

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:11.450
Please hear my prayers!

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:18.080
-intersection-

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.450
When we are born,

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:21.200
we cry that we are come to this great stage of fools...

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.000
To Gekkou, my faithful servant:
I will hear your worries.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.250
M..Maria-sama?!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:30.500
Maria-sama sent me a text message?!

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:37.290
Sensei, Itabashi-kun fell out of his chair.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.790
It's probably his usual curse or something like that...

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.200
Just leave him be.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:46.540
Maria-sama heard my confession
and gave me her guidance.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.290
I am in the midst of battle with a demon.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.500
His name is Ryuuou.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.870
Ryuuou?

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.500
I ask for your help.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.370
O-of course!

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:01.000
Anything for you, Maria-sama!

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:05.080
Ryuuou's underlings will appear at your school.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.540
I want you to observe their actions carefully.

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:12.500
This noise ringing in my head
tells me where that demon is located...

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:15.250
Nurse's
Office

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:14.870
The nurse's office?

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:17.750
An avatar of evil lurks in here?

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.950
That's Setagaya-sensei, the Biology teacher...

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.750
And that woman,

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:28.250
she's one of Ryuuou's underlings, Fujiko Taito.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:32.250
Fujiko Taito-san. Why don't we make a trade?

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.750
A trade?

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.370
I have information about the people who bought SCMs.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.450
You have a vested interest in that, yes?

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.660
And what do you want in return?

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:45.450
I want you to wear this SCM.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.120
What are you planning?

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:51.410
I understand your caution,
but please, there is no need to worry.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:53.950
I do not plan on challenging you to a duel.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:55.750
Then, why?

00:04:55.750 --> 00:05:00.370
I was once involved in the development of the SCMs.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:05.410
I'm very curious to see
if there are any flaws in your SCMs.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.160
Give me that first.

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:09.700
Here.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.830
Thank you very much.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.080
This won't take long at all.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:26.330
That was the sound of a game starting!

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:28.290
Why'd it go off on its own?

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:32.580
To tell the truth, this SCM is specially made...

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:37.080
I call it the Judgement SCM.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.750
Judgement?!

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.540
That's right, because it has the power to pass judgement!

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:46.580
I don't need to engage others in duels.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:51.040
You have already become my slave.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.750
No...

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.370
What a heinous act!

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:02.200
Maria-sama...

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:06.200
The demon... those demons are right here!

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:11.790
Maria-sama! Please forgive me!

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:15.830
I could not do anything when confronted
by the sight of those demons!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:19.290
I could not find Ryuuou's other underling!

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:22.580
I see. What a useless maggot you are.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.370
However, Gekkou...

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.620
I will forgive you.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:41.200
My mistress, Maria-sama!

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:46.580
Gekkou, I have another duty for you.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:47.540
Yes, M'lady!

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:49.500
My target is moving.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.370
I want you to go on ahead of him and set a trap.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.370
This is an SCM.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:59.290
I give it to you as a sign of your loyalty to me.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.870
I am truly honored!

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:05.200
My comrade Kiyo will be present in that location.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:07.790
Do as she says.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:08.620
Yes, M'lady!

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:12.040
I will destroy this Ryuuou if it costs me my life!

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:17.080
My soul is yours, Maria-sama!

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:29.410
Gekkou was a regular viewer of my streams
who always sent in weird questions.

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:29.790
Maria-sama

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.040
Once I talked to him, though,

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:37.580
I found out he could hear the sounds
emitted by activated SCMs.

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:41.290
I asked him to use that power to help me, but...

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:45.200
Working with him is really exhausting.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.950
But it's all for Senpai.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:52.450
I'm going to help Kiyo-senpai!

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:03.920
All
Call Log

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:03.920
(No Answer)
Julia Katsushika (3)
Duration 15 sec
Ataru Chuo
(No Answer)
Julia Katsushika (2)

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.950
Huh? Ryuuou-kun?

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.120
Zero? What are you doing here?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.450
Uh, Chuo-san told me to come here...

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:23.450
He said Julia or Fujiko was going to
meet up with you at this park.

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:25.910
Why are you here, Ryuuou-kun?

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.160
No reason.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:30.790
I see, just on a walk?

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:36.160
We haven't heard anything from either of them...

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.620
And school is closed now. Did something happen?

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:49.040
I am a ray of light, cutting through the darkness!

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:50.950
I am Gekkou!

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:55.700
I have come forth on the orders of Maria-sama!

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.500
Do you know him, Ryuuou-kun?

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.290
I certainly don't.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:08.040
You're-!

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:11.790
You're the leader of those demons? You're Ryuuou?!

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.540
Maria-sama! I stand before the demon Ryuuou himself!

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:18.160
Please answer me, Maria-sama! Lend me your guidance!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:18.620
Zero.
Please answer me, Maria-sama! Lend me your guidance!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:19.450
Huh?
Please answer me, Maria-sama! Lend me your guidance!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.620
Do it. That's an order.
Please answer me, Maria-sama! Lend me your guidance!

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:22.330
Uh huh...

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.080
Sorry!

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.620
I won't let you call for your friends.

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:31.450
You bastard... you seek to ridicule me!

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:37.120
Ryuuou! I, Gekkou Itabashi,
will bring punishment down upon you!

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:38.790
And you!

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:41.700
You are Kiyo, are you not?!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.700
Maria-sama said that you were!

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:47.700
Huh? No, I'm Zero...

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:54.870
Zero? What's wrong?

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:59.620
Don't worry. I'll take care of him.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:04.700
Umm, you said your name was Gekkou, yes?

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:07.700
Duel me.

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:16.200
I'm Kiyo. Heed my instructions.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.040
The duel will be...

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:22.540
I've got it, let's play "Look That Way".

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.330
You know how to play, right?

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:27.290
O-of course I do!

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.700
Now!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.620
Let's begin!

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:35.120
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.000
Look that way!

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:38.910
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:40.330
Look that way!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.160
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:43.500
Look that way!

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.500
Alright! I win.

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:51.000
All taken care of, Ryuuou-kun.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.120
What did you whisper to him?

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:56.000
Oh, that? It was nothing.

00:10:57.160 --> 00:11:04.750
If I put in my SCM, the guy Zero enslaved
should be transferred from his master to me...

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.200
The proximity alert!

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:12.950
It shouldn't go off around my slaves!

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:16.410
I've been waiting, Ryuuou.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:25.370
Waiting for the moment you put in your SCM.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.200
Zero, you're supposed to be my slave.

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.950
I'm not Zero right now.

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:42.540
"Right now"?

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:43.950
Ryuuou!

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:52.040
Chuo-san, what's going on here?

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:56.410
I don't know. Did someone make Zero a slave
and use him to attack Ryuuou?

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:58.950
Stop them, Gekkou!

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.410
With pleasure, sir!

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:04.580
Now, demonic underlings, I'll take you down!

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:09.330
Stay back!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:19.330
Dammit... I was so close...

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:20.700
Who are you?

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:25.830
I am Kiyo.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:34.580
Get in, quick!

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:35.830
Maria-sama!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.500
Maria-sama, you and I are one in body and soul!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.660
Shut up, moron! Just get in the car!
Maria-sama, you and I are one in body and soul!

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:45.080
What was that?

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:48.330
Dunno. Stop asking me that all the time.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.330
Zero and Kiyo?

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.370
That plan failed...

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:59.500
I'm sorry. I couldn't help you.

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:03.120
No, you helped a lot. Thanks.

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:10.120
I reunited with Kiyo-senpai one week ago.

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:15.130
Maria
Chiyoda

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:19.120
WHOOOA!
Maria-sama!

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:19.120
I've been waiting for this!
What is this?! So Cool!
That doll is so cute!
This video is neat!

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.620
Jeez, what is it?

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:33.660
Yeah, I'm comin'!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:41.040
Maria, please... Save this boy, Zero!

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:44.000
Who are you?

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.290
It's me! Kiyo!

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.160
Don't you remember me?

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:50.870
Huh? Kiyo? You mean Kiyo Koto?

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:52.040
Yeah, that's me!

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:56.580
What're you talking about?
Kiyo-senpai is a girl. You're a boy!

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:02.040
And Kiyo-senpai died a long while back.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.290
Hmm, where should I start?

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:12.290
According to the boy, his name was Zero Shinagawa,
and his mother was Kiyo Koto.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:19.830
For some reason, Kiyo's mind joined
with that of her son, Zero, and brought herself to me.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:23.040
You know, I owe my life to Kiyo-senpai.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:26.000
Could you stop using her name?

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.200
I'm not lying! You have to believe me!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:31.700
I don't have much time.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:36.750
In any case, Maria, just help Zero!

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.950
This is his address!

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:46.600
KOTO...
SHINAGAWA
APARTMENT...

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.660
What the hell?

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:52.750
Twenty years ago, I got in a bit of trouble with the police
and spent some time in their care.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:56.870
I'd never been locked in a cold cell before.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.080
That's where I met her.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:03.290
Hey, what'd you do to get in here?

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:06.750
Kiyo Koto was my senpai.

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:11.200
Oh yeah? You punched an annoying guy
in the face? Good for you!

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:14.080
I couldn't take him making fun of me anymore.

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:16.580
After I worked so hard to get into that school...

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:20.120
This is way better than shutting up and letting it happen!

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:26.120
I tried to borrow some money from a wallet,
when suddenly, the police were right there!

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:33.620
Kiyo Koto was friendly and positive,
and gave her all trying to talk to someone like me.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.910
What kinda school was it?

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.250
Beauty school.

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:41.160
Whoa, girl, that's so cool!

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:44.660
Hey, let's hang out sometime!

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:45.950
Huh?

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:47.910
I'm your senpai here.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:50.330
You've gotta listen to your senpai, you know!

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:52.950
Okay.

00:15:53.120 --> 00:16:00.410
Back then, if I hadn't met Kiyo-senpai in that crazy place,
if she hadn't encouraged me with her bright words,

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.370
I might not even be around right now.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:03.750
Cheers!

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:06.290
But...

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:11.200
Senpai got into a bad car accident and died.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:11.200
The Deceased:
Kiyo Koto

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:14.330
The Deceased:
Kiyo Koto

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:14.330
Pedestrian hit by truck driver asleep at the wheel

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.330
So why is she...?

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.500
Hello?

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.700
I'm here for you!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:27.080
So, tell me what this is all about!

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.200
Who are you?

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:31.830
Jesus...

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.910
Don't you play dumb with me!

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:40.080
Stop toying with me!

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.450
I dunno if you're trying to scam me or something,

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:45.580
but you're a real scumbag
to use the name of a dead woman!

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:49.830
I'm sorry, I'm sorry! I think I'm sick!

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:51.290
Sick?

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:54.580
Lately, I've had these blank spaces in my memory...

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.160
I have no idea what I do during those blackouts.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:01.370
I'm sorry if I did something rude!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:07.040
Your name's Zero Shinagawa, right?

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:08.080
Yes.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:11.620
You really don't know anything? What about Kiyo Koto?

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:13.910
Huh? Who's that?

00:17:14.120 --> 00:17:16.580
Who's that? That's your mother, isn't it?

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:20.580
My mother? Kiyo... Koto?

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:23.660
Agh, my head... hurts!

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.950
Hey, are you okay?!

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:30.500
Stop! Stop it, Maria!

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:35.160
Zero doesn't remember my name!

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:38.160
Wha... no.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.830
You're really Kiyo-senpai?

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.910
But you're supposed to be dead!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:50.700
I don't know, but this is what made it happen.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:54.450
I died in an accident when Zero was young.

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:58.950
In his shock, Zero lost all memory
of what happened before that moment.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:04.330
I awoke from within Zero when he put on this SCM.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:08.700
SCM? That thing they say can turn people into slaves?

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:09.330
Yes.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:13.200
From the moment Zero was enslaved
by a boy named Ryuuou,

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:17.580
I have been able to take over Zero's body
for short periods of time.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:22.830
I can't do it whenever I want,
but I get a little bit of time each day.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:27.120
Senpai, what should I do?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:32.120
I want you to rescue my son,
Zero Shinagawa, from servitude.

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:39.040
To do that, you need to wear an SCM,
fight Zero's Master, Ryuuou,

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:41.040
and beat him in a duel.

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:44.160
Of course, I'll take on Ryuuou myself.

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:47.250
I just need your help doing it, Maria.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.250
I have three SCM devices.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:53.750
The first is mine, not Zero's.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:58.750
I'll use this to beat Ryuuou in a duel as Kiyo Koto.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:02.250
These two are for you, Maria.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.580
You'll wear one of them.

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:09.660
My abilities are limited, so if worse comes to worst,
I want you to have one.

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.290
And the last one?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:17.290
If you find someone else you think will help you,
I want you to use it on them.

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:20.200
I'll think about it.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:22.290
I've got a phone Zero doesn't know about.

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:25.040
I'll contact you when I get the chance.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:31.120
Thank you, Maria, for helping us.

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:36.540
I don't know if I can be of much help, but I'll do my best.

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:40.250
Once Zero gets his freedom,
I won't have any more regrets.

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:44.290
If we save Zero-kun from slavery, Senpai, will you...?

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.330
No...

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:51.830
Once Zero-kun is free, will you take me out
for an expensive dinner?

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.790
Yeah, sure! It'll be on Zero's dime, though.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.790
Maria-sama!

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.330
Give me another order!

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.790
Go to Zero-kun's place and bring me his things!

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:06.450
Wha-huh?!

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:09.290
Don't tell me you're going to shack up with Zero!

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:10.790
I've got no choice!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.830
If he goes home, Ryuuou will take him back!

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.580
Shut up and hurry!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.580
Yes, M'lady!

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:21.290
Maria, Zero's about to come back.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:23.450
It's in your hands.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:31.120
Where am I...?

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.370
I-it's alright!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.290
Wh-who are you?! Why...

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.620
Calm down, please!

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:40.870
I'm... yeah... I'm a counselor!

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:43.200
I'm here to help you!

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:48.370
This time, I'm going to help both you and Kiyo-senpai!

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:52.620
Guess they're after Ryuuou...

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:56.120
They must've stolen Zero at some point.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:59.000
No, that wasn't Zero.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.450
What do you mean?

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:04.950
Another personality living inside of Zero
resisted the SCM's control.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.790
Multiple personalities?

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:10.540
Nothing surprises me anymore.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:14.790
Probably best if we assume that
all of our information's been leaked to the other side.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:20.330
We still haven't solved the case of the star symbol SCM,
and Julia and Fujiko are still missing.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:22.790
What do we do now, Ryuuou?

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:27.700
In any case, it's late.

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.910
Let's go back to your place, Ryuuou.

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.790
Julia...

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:41.040
You're all such diligent little worker ants,

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:44.950
busily going about looking for food.

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:50.540
In light of your diligence,
I suppose I should begin the harvest!

00:22:03.910 --> 00:22:06.290
Master Ryuuou...

00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:21.040
-intersection-

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:27.660
The ultimate game is testing my heart

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:32.450
A strategy that starts from a one-on-one

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:35.120
It's getting close, do I attack or pull back

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:36.910
Play defense or offense on the brink?

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:40.040
Tell me, which is better?

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:44.290
I don't care if the rules leave me without a chance

00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:50.500
I have one last chance in my hand for my unclear future

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:55.660
Does the deck in front of me shine light on that future?

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:05.250
Examining your visible and hidden expression, my fate concealed

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:10.410
Drawing forth luck, I don't want to lose

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:14.160
I can't evolve if I keep saying "I can't"

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:18.790
I'll win my game with you

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:26.620
And overcome all barriers, so I never go bust again

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:45.410
-fall-
